2,Njalgulgule | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/njl/,"Njalgulgule is an endangered indigenous language of South Sudan. It belongs to the Nilo-Saharan language family. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by older adults only.",Njalgulgule,Nilo-Saharan
